// Sensor is the service-protocol bundled sensor services
// (sensors/sensor-cron, sensors/sensor-http, sensors/sensor-object-store,
// sensors/sensor-webhook) implement. Rimsky's control-api drives
// sensor lifecycle at instance create / terminate via StartWatch /
// StopWatch, and reconciles sensor state after a rimsky restart via
// ListWatches.
//
// Sensors observe external events; on observation they POST to
// rimsky's HTTP endpoint `POST /sensors/{watch_id}/observations`
